{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The world has been overrun by Plushes</strong><br>Yes, that\u2019s right\u00a0<strong>\u2013</strong> plushy creatures. Cute, soft and completely insane!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are a</strong> <strong>Plush Fighter</strong><br>A young hero with a gun and a shovel.\u00a0Save Moscow from the disaster and find your sister!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through a city full of mysteries, use the Plushes themselves as weapons, resources, and tools, steal powers from bosses, and unlock access to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, fight, adapt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cute, but Deadly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Plush has its own logic and behavior. Study them and turn their features to your advantage! They scream, jump, roll, shove, spit, explode, and cause you endless trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t trust those adorable button eyes<strong>. </strong>Plushes have already destroyed half the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/7d76b69b68ffcb44b1b51ad68dd8cbaf.poster.avif?t=1753472697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/7d76b69b68ffcb44b1b51ad68dd8cbaf.webm?t=1753472697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/7d76b69b68ffcb44b1b51ad68dd8cbaf.mp4?t=1753472697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Enemy\u2019s Power Is Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat bosses and claim their abilities. Summon giant Plushes as allies in battle. Freeze, burn, crush!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/86d1516101aa122c54c079b35de1bdcd.poster.avif?t=1753472697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/86d1516101aa122c54c079b35de1bdcd.webm?t=1753472697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/86d1516101aa122c54c079b35de1bdcd.mp4?t=1753472697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plush as a Tool</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use enemy powers to solve puzzles, break barriers, and reach hidden areas on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/c0f3cf56d20011afe149937075f007db.poster.avif?t=1753472697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/c0f3cf56d20011afe149937075f007db.webm?t=1753472697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/c0f3cf56d20011afe149937075f007db.mp4?t=1753472697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Story on the Edge of Trash and Drama</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your sister, uncover the origin of the Plushes, and survive the chaos. And if you can't, die gloriously or with a padding polyester<strong> </strong>on your face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Metroidvania-style progression through new abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plushes as loot, consumables, and tactical resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elemental combos: freeze, blow up, clear the path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration of multi-layered locations filled with secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon defeated bosses to fight by your side</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles centered around Plush-based abilities</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3297800?t=1753472697","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753472697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/b9fb6aa98a15e6f1f7baae0b801dbdbeafd25887/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753472697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/b9fb6aa98a15e6f1f7baae0b801dbdbeafd25887/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753472697","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The world has been overrun by Plushes</strong><br>Yes, that\u2019s right\u00a0<strong>\u2013</strong> plushy creatures. Cute, soft and completely insane!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are a</strong> <strong>Plush Fighter</strong><br>A young hero with a gun and a shovel.\u00a0Save Moscow from the disaster and find your sister!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through a city full of mysteries, use the Plushes themselves as weapons, resources, and tools, steal powers from bosses, and unlock access to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, fight, adapt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cute, but Deadly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Plush has its own logic and behavior. Study them and turn their features to your advantage! They scream, jump, roll, shove, spit, explode, and cause you endless trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t trust those adorable button eyes<strong>. </strong>Plushes have already destroyed half the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/7d76b69b68ffcb44b1b51ad68dd8cbaf.poster.avif?t=1753472697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/7d76b69b68ffcb44b1b51ad68dd8cbaf.webm?t=1753472697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/7d76b69b68ffcb44b1b51ad68dd8cbaf.mp4?t=1753472697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Enemy\u2019s Power Is Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat bosses and claim their abilities. Summon giant Plushes as allies in battle. Freeze, burn, crush!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/86d1516101aa122c54c079b35de1bdcd.poster.avif?t=1753472697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/86d1516101aa122c54c079b35de1bdcd.webm?t=1753472697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/86d1516101aa122c54c079b35de1bdcd.mp4?t=1753472697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plush as a Tool</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragrap